message: >-
  If you use UrbanFlow in academic work, please cite this repository.
  如果您在学术工作中使用 UrbanFlow，请引用本仓库。
title: "UrbanFlow: City Demand Forecasting and Dispatch Support Platform"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "UrbanFlow Contributors"
abstract: >-
  An open-source MVP for city demand time-series forecasting using synthetic
  data, Kafka, Spark, PyTorch, FastAPI, and Vue. 一个使用虚拟数据、
  Kafka、Spark、PyTorch、FastAPI 和 Vue 构建的城市需求时序预测开源项目。
keywords:
  - time series forecasting
  - urban demand
  - Spark
  - Kafka
  - PyTorch
  - FastAPI
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
